# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1/v2

Allowed: app + Go `/forecast` resource, nested overlay panel, Druid→minute-of-week baseline→Kafka publisher (app Configuration + backend ticker).

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- Docker Compose / TestData sandbox (sibling `timeseries-grafana-sandbox`)
- Grafana.com signing/publish
- Prometheus
- Prediction intervals or alerting
- A forked Series or forecast implementation
- Extra app pages beyond landing + Configuration
- Reading the metrics Kafka topic (use Druid SQL)

## Use the sibling libraries

Call `timeseries` and `timeseries-forecast` through their public APIs. Local development uses `replace => ../timeseries` and `replace => ../timeseries-forecast`.
